# Intentionally empty. src/config.ts's loadEnvironment() requires a .env file to exist, even
# though process environment values always take precedence over its contents (see
# docs/decisions.md "Configuration"). In containers all real configuration and secrets come from
# docker-compose.yml's `environment:`/`secrets:` (VAR/VAR_FILE; see src/secrets.ts), never from
# this file -- it exists only so that startup check is satisfied without baking any value,
# secret or otherwise, into the image.
